=== v2.0 ===

    - This version was modified to take into consideration files of only a
      few K, like text files, that could be Uploaded or Downloaded resulting
      in a VERY HIGH CPS Rate.
    - This version uses a SysOp Definable MINIMUM KByte Length before it will
      actually USE this program. This should hopefully STOP those HUGE CPS
      Rates from happening again.
    - Other BRAND NEW FEATURES include:
        - Separate Upload/Download HighCPS Files, ALONG with Baud Files.
        - Date Stamps are now included within the HighCPS files which can
          now allow them to be RESET every SYSOP DEFINABLE days. This will
          allow for NEW users to get a chance at holding the "record"...
    - Upward compatibility built in by using SysOp Definable Variables.
    - Release Date: 5 June 1993

